40/extras_big/cda908564b955267bbced7b21347b566.avif?t=1762308560 width=800 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The God Heroes</strong> is a 2.5D metroidvania filled with challenges and intense combat. You play as <strong>Fezuki</strong>, a warrior searching for his lost memories, destined to become a Guardian and protect the universe from the Entity of Darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/f050a47f72574c94a0d54e59482c6d0d.poster.avif?t=1762308560\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/f050a47f72574c94a0d54e59482c6d0d.webm?t=1762308560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/f050a47f72574c94a0d54e59482c6d0d.mp4?t=1762308560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is a path: when defeated, Fezuki awakens in the <strong>Realm of the Dead</strong>, where his mother, the goddess Morthy, gives him missions. To return, he must gather the <strong>12 Zodiac Keys</strong> hidden across realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, swap armor with unique abilities, and uncover the secrets between life and death in this epic metroidvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/489ef0a4e4197a7fc3944f163c128434.poster.avif?t=1762308560\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2